 get involved and  hopefully they have money to bring but  also a little bit of experience and  connections within the ski or snowboard  industry and then use the money that you  make from that person mention to fund  future inventions and it could be again  with the same partners or you can go out  on your own and do it yourself that's  what i would do i'll try to connect with  people  who I know or who know me through the  products that I've created if you have a  big track record of success inventing  cool products in the ski snowboard  industry and I try to focus on that  instead of going for the business plan  and document root you can still try if  you think you'll have a much greater  checks success working with individual  investors who know your industry and who  believe is how the products is created  so I hope that helps Michael for  everybody else if you enjoyed the video  i love it if you can get with a thumbs  up and will create more videos just like  it and I'd also love to hear your  thoughts and feedback if you want to  leave a comment below the video and stay  tuned for the next episode  you
 

